%I A400641 #4 Oct 04 2026 15:41:36
%S A400641 1,1,2,4,17,447,203226,28726247764,47032788786083636716
%N A400641 Number of equivalence classes of self-dual monotone Boolean functions of n variables under cyclic rotations of the variables.
%C A400641 Two self-dual monotone Boolean functions are equivalent if one is obtained from the other by a cyclic permutation of the variables.
%F A400641 Let Fix(pi) be the number of self-dual monotone Boolean functions of n variables fixed by the permutation pi of the variables.
%F A400641 a(n) = (1/n) * Sum_{k=0..n-1} Fix(rho^k), where rho = (1,2,...,n).
%F A400641 Equivalently, a(n) = (1/n) * Sum_{d|n} phi(d) * Fix(d^(n/d)), where Fix(d^(n/d)) denotes Fix(pi) for a permutation pi of cycle type d^(n/d).
%e A400641 For n = 9, Fix(1^9) = 423295099074735261880, Fix(9) = 70, and Fix(3^3) = 8734072. Hence a(9) = (423295099074735261880 + 6*70 + 2*8734072)/9 = 47032788786083636716.
%Y A400641 Cf. A001206, A008840, A400640.
